{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It's like the <i>Papers, Please</i> of 2020.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TooStupidGamerz</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/1064a633c77ece7b66f356a2e47f2eee.poster.avif?t=1771892323\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/1064a633c77ece7b66f356a2e47f2eee.webm?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/1064a633c77ece7b66f356a2e47f2eee.mp4?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Rainy City, meet its residents and save your sister!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to make deliveries for Betty's Pizza in this story-based game set in a cyberpunk future where the pandemic never went away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a worker with a mission- your sister Naomi is getting sick, and you need to raise enough money to get her into treatment before she gets any worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/0b7db403f72701779ef2bda549482b0d.poster.avif?t=1771892323\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/0b7db403f72701779ef2bda549482b0d.webm?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/0b7db403f72701779ef2bda549482b0d.mp4?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the streets of Rainy City while delivering to people scattered around town.  You'll meet customers from all walks of life- from friendly neighbors to illicit party animals and miscreants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/ac6282e54984dbefc77034953377a164.poster.avif?t=1771892323\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/ac6282e54984dbefc77034953377a164.webm?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/ac6282e54984dbefc77034953377a164.mp4?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/7f27041316055829f6a034e45ceb438f.poster.avif?t=1771892323\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/7f27041316055829f6a034e45ceb438f.webm?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/7f27041316055829f6a034e45ceb438f.mp4?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to how their lives have changed and how they're dealing with the pandemic- and reflect on your own history too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything in Rainy City is bleak- there's hope and optimism out there if you're looking for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/b3bb25e0195978b661cf6191ce86747d.poster.avif?t=1771892323\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/b3bb25e0195978b661cf6191ce86747d.webm?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/b3bb25e0195978b661cf6191ce86747d.mp4?t=1771892323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make enough deliveries in time to save your sister??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316050/extras/679a074cfe99b26f74ae111f82ac4937.webp?t=1771892323\" width=600 height=1 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer music: &quot;Chill Wave&quot; Kevin MacLeod </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 3.0,  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"45692a9a13c02fca7df03a1be46d2079646ee01e.jpg","localized_name":"On Your Way","name":"On Your Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316050/45692a9a13c02fca7df03a1be46d2079646ee01e.jpg"},{"icon":"241a1f39ff5118cbe3056f47faf47fd1d35d68ec.jpg","localized_name":"Dangerous Delivery","name":"Dangerous Delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316050/241a1f39ff5118cbe3056f47faf47fd1d35d68ec.jpg"},{"icon":"fb372364246e6f8cb72631c9bc459cc6b19f1d31.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome to the Neighborhood","name":"Welcome to the Neighborhood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316050/fb372364246e6f8cb72631c9bc459cc6b19f1d31.jpg"},{"icon":"0d58e54cc09991a444cba2c3079339938085db39.jpg","localized_name":"Take Tha